    # Research
    I am interested in the field of computational biology, specifically
    in the use of parallel computing to construct cellular and gene regulatory
    networks from gene expression data. I am also interested in developing
    parallel algorithms in the analysis of high-throughput sequencing reads
    such as error correction and clustering.

