    # Past Life
    Prior to being a Ph.D student, I used to work as a software engineer in an
    IT consultancy company. I have over eight years of experience
    as a software engineer, four of which I was also as a project leader. My work involved
    in developing software to manage multiple versions of product engineering
    designs, all throughout the product's life cycle.  A summary of my past work is
    [here](http://www.linkedin.com/in/srirampc).
